        &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://benfernandezmedia.github.io/images/promo/mediaplay_crystal.png&#34; alt=&#34;MediaPlay Promo Banner&#34;  data-zoomable loading=&#34;lazy&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hi, I&amp;rsquo;m Crystal!&lt;/strong&gt; The main hostess of the brand new MediaPlay newsletter here on the official website of BFM and also on Patreon!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MediaPlay is the all-new newsletter where I review what&amp;rsquo;s going on in the world of digital entertainment, gaming, and new stuff related to indie animations that has been going around in the center of the web and on-demand through streaming platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a lot to check out in the future as we dig deep into what&amp;rsquo;s hot across the communities around your favorite content and, of course, look at what&amp;rsquo;s coming soon for the content you want to see!&lt;/p&gt;

      </description>
    </item>
    
